# Magic Damper needs a creature you control (CR 115.1): with only Bot2's Ornithopter on the battlefield it is not offered,
# and with Ornithopters of Bot1's it is, though it cannot name Bot2's. After it resolves, Bot1's first Ornithopter has
# hexproof (CR 702.11b), so Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target it, while the same Bolt can target Bot1's second
# Ornithopter, which has none (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Magic Damper
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Magic Damper.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
! Bot1.Hand.Magic Damper.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Magic Damper.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Hexproof
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
